{"task_id": "Mbpp/71", "solution": "def comb_sort(lst):\n    \"\"\"Sorts a list using the comb sort algorithm with gap reduction.\"\"\"\n    if len(lst) <= 1:\n        return lst\n    \n    result = lst[:]\n    gap = len(result)\n    shrink = 1.3\n    swapped = True\n    \n    while gap > 1 or swapped:\n        gap = int(gap / shrink)\n        if gap < 1:\n            gap = 1\n        \n        swapped = False\n        for i in range(len(result) - gap):\n            if result[i] > result[i + gap]:\n                result[i], result[i + gap] = result[i + gap], result[i]\n                swapped = True\n    \n    return result"}
