{"task_id": "Mbpp/103", "solution": "def eulerian_num(n, m):\n    \"\"\"Calculate the Eulerian number A(n,m) using dynamic programming.\"\"\"\n    if n == 0 and m == 0:\n        return 1\n    if m < 0 or m >= n:\n        return 0\n    \n    dp = [[0] * (n + 1) for _ in range(n + 1)]\n    dp[0][0] = 1\n    \n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        for j in range(i):\n            dp[i][j] = (j + 1) * dp[i-1][j] + (i - j) * dp[i-1][j-1] if j > 0 else dp[i-1][j]\n    \n    return dp[n][m]"}
