{"task_id": "Mbpp/103", "solution": "def eulerian_num(n, m):\n    \"\"\"Computes the Eulerian number A(n,m) using dynamic programming.\"\"\"\n    if m < 0 or m >= n:\n        return 0\n    if n == 0:\n        return 1 if m == 0 else 0\n    \n    # Create DP table\n    dp = [[0] * n for _ in range(n + 1)]\n    dp[0][0] = 1\n    \n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        for j in range(i):\n            if j == 0:\n                dp[i][j] = 1\n            else:\n                dp[i][j] = (j + 1) * dp[i-1][j] + (i - j) * dp[i-1][j-1]\n    \n    return dp[n][m]"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/100", "solution": "def next_smallest_palindrome(n):\n    s = str(n + 1)\n    length = len(s)\n    \n    while True:\n        # Check if current number is palindrome\n        if s == s[::-1]:\n            return int(s)\n        \n        # Make it palindrome by mirroring left half to right half\n        mid = length // 2\n        if length % 2 == 0:\n            # Even length\n            left_half = s[:mid]\n            candidate = left_half + left_half[::-1]\n        else:\n            # Odd length\n            left_half = s[:mid]\n            middle = s[mid]\n            candidate = left_half + middle + left_half[::-1]\n        \n        # If candidate is greater than current number, return it\n        if int(candidate) > n:\n            return int(candidate)\n        \n        # Otherwise increment the middle part and try again\n        if length % 2 == 0:\n            left_num = int(s[:mid]) + 1\n            left_str = str(left_num).zfill(mid)\n            if len(left_str) > mid:\n                # Overflow, need longer palindrome\n                return int('1' + '0' * (length - 1) + '1')\n            s = left_str + left_str[::-1]\n        else:\n            mid_and_left = int(s[:mid + 1]) + 1\n            mid_and_left_str = str(mid_and_left).zfill(mid + 1)\n            if len(mid_and_left_str) > mid + 1:\n                # Overflow, need longer palindrome\n                return int('1' + '0' * (length - 1) + '1')\n            left_part = mid_and_left_str[:-1]\n            middle_part = mid_and_left_str[-1]\n            s = left_part + middle_part + left_part[::-1]"}
