{"task_id": "Mbpp/123", "solution": "def amicable_numbers_sum(n):\n    \"\"\"Sum all amicable numbers from 1 to n.\"\"\"\n    def sum_proper_divisors(num):\n        return sum(i for i in range(1, num) if num % i == 0)\n    \n    total = 0\n    for i in range(1, n + 1):\n        divisor_sum = sum_proper_divisors(i)\n        if divisor_sum != i and divisor_sum <= n and sum_proper_divisors(divisor_sum) == i:\n            total += i\n    return total"}
