{"task_id": "Mbpp/141", "solution": "def pancake_sort(arr):\n    \"\"\"Sort array using pancake sort algorithm by flipping subarrays.\"\"\"\n    def flip(arr, k):\n        return arr[:k+1][::-1] + arr[k+1:]\n    \n    if len(arr) <= 1:\n        return arr\n    \n    result = arr[:]\n    n = len(result)\n    \n    for curr_size in range(n, 1, -1):\n        max_idx = result[:curr_size].index(max(result[:curr_size]))\n        \n        if max_idx != curr_size - 1:\n            if max_idx != 0:\n                result = flip(result, max_idx)\n            result = flip(result, curr_size - 1)\n    \n    return result"}
