{"task_id": "Mbpp/223", "solution": "def is_majority(arr, n, x):\n    # Find first and last occurrence of x using binary search\n    def find_first(arr, n, x):\n        left, right = 0, n - 1\n        first = -1\n        while left <= right:\n            mid = (left + right) // 2\n            if arr[mid] == x:\n                first = mid\n                right = mid - 1\n            elif arr[mid] < x:\n                left = mid + 1\n            else:\n                right = mid - 1\n        return first\n    \n    def find_last(arr, n, x):\n        left, right = 0, n - 1\n        last = -1\n        while left <= right:\n            mid = (left + right) // 2\n            if arr[mid] == x:\n                last = mid\n                left = mid + 1\n            elif arr[mid] < x:\n                left = mid + 1\n            else:\n                right = mid - 1\n        return last\n    \n    first = find_first(arr, n, x)\n    if first == -1:\n        return False\n    \n    last = find_last(arr, n, x)\n    count = last - first + 1\n    return count > n // 2"}
