{"task_id": "Mbpp/223", "solution": "def is_majority(arr, n, element):\n    # Find first and last occurrence of element\n    first = -1\n    last = -1\n    \n    # Binary search for first occurrence\n    left, right = 0, n - 1\n    while left <= right:\n        mid = (left + right) // 2\n        if arr[mid] == element:\n            first = mid\n            right = mid - 1\n        elif arr[mid] < element:\n            left = mid + 1\n        else:\n            right = mid - 1\n    \n    if first == -1:\n        return False\n    \n    # Binary search for last occurrence\n    left, right = 0, n - 1\n    while left <= right:\n        mid = (left + right) // 2\n        if arr[mid] == element:\n            last = mid\n            left = mid + 1\n        elif arr[mid] < element:\n            left = mid + 1\n        else:\n            right = mid - 1\n    \n    # Check if count is more than n/2\n    count = last - first + 1\n    return count > n // 2"}
