{"task_id": "Mbpp/235", "solution": "def even_bit_set_number(n):\n    \"\"\"Sets all even-positioned bits (0, 2, 4, ...) to 1 in the given number.\"\"\"\n    mask = 0\n    bit_pos = 0\n    temp = n\n    \n    # Find the highest bit position\n    while temp > 0:\n        temp >>= 1\n        bit_pos += 1\n    \n    # Create mask with all even bits set\n    for i in range(0, bit_pos + 2, 2):\n        mask |= (1 << i)\n    \n    return n | mask"}
