{"task_id": "Mbpp/245", "solution": "def max_sum(arr):\n    n = len(arr)\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n    if n == 1:\n        return arr[0]\n    \n    # Calculate increasing subsequence sums ending at each position\n    inc = arr[:]\n    for i in range(1, n):\n        for j in range(i):\n            if arr[j] < arr[i]:\n                inc[i] = max(inc[i], inc[j] + arr[i])\n    \n    # Calculate decreasing subsequence sums starting from each position\n    dec = arr[:]\n    for i in range(n - 2, -1, -1):\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            if arr[i] > arr[j]:\n                dec[i] = max(dec[i], dec[j] + arr[i])\n    \n    # Find maximum bitonic sum\n    max_bitonic = 0\n    for i in range(n):\n        max_bitonic = max(max_bitonic, inc[i] + dec[i] - arr[i])\n    \n    return max_bitonic"}
