{"task_id": "Mbpp/260", "solution": "def newman_prime(n):\n    \"\"\"Returns the nth Newman-Shanks-Williams prime number.\"\"\"\n    def is_prime(num):\n        if num < 2:\n            return False\n        for i in range(2, int(num ** 0.5) + 1):\n            if num % i == 0:\n                return False\n        return True\n    \n    def newman_shanks_williams(k):\n        if k == 0:\n            return 1\n        if k == 1:\n            return 1\n        a, b = 1, 1\n        for i in range(2, k + 1):\n            a, b = b, 2 * b + a\n        return b\n    \n    count = 0\n    k = 1\n    while count < n:\n        nsw = newman_shanks_williams(k)\n        if is_prime(nsw):\n            count += 1\n            if count == n:\n                return nsw\n        k += 1"}
