{"task_id": "Mbpp/274", "solution": "def even_binomial_Coeff_Sum(n):\n    \"\"\"Returns sum of binomial coefficients at even indices for (1+x)^n.\"\"\"\n    def binomial_coeff(n, k):\n        if k > n or k < 0:\n            return 0\n        if k == 0 or k == n:\n            return 1\n        result = 1\n        for i in range(min(k, n - k)):\n            result = result * (n - i) // (i + 1)\n        return result\n    \n    total = 0\n    for i in range(0, n + 1, 2):\n        total += binomial_coeff(n, i)\n    return total"}
