{"task_id": "Mbpp/286", "solution": "def max_sub_array_sum_repeated(arr, n, k):\n    \"\"\"Find maximum subarray sum in array repeated k times.\"\"\"\n    if k == 1:\n        max_ending_here = max_so_far = arr[0]\n        for i in range(1, n):\n            max_ending_here = max(arr[i], max_ending_here + arr[i])\n            max_so_far = max(max_so_far, max_ending_here)\n        return max_so_far\n    \n    # Calculate max subarray sum for single array\n    max_ending_here = max_so_far = arr[0]\n    for i in range(1, n):\n        max_ending_here = max(arr[i], max_ending_here + arr[i])\n        max_so_far = max(max_so_far, max_ending_here)\n    \n    single_max = max_so_far\n    \n    # Calculate total sum of array\n    total_sum = sum(arr)\n    \n    # Calculate max prefix sum\n    max_prefix = curr_sum = 0\n    for i in range(n):\n        curr_sum += arr[i]\n        max_prefix = max(max_prefix, curr_sum)\n    \n    # Calculate max suffix sum\n    max_suffix = curr_sum = 0\n    for i in range(n-1, -1, -1):\n        curr_sum += arr[i]\n        max_suffix = max(max_suffix, curr_sum)\n    \n    if total_sum > 0:\n        return max(single_max, max_suffix + max_prefix + total_sum * (k - 2))\n    else:\n        return max(single_max, max_suffix + max_prefix)"}
