{"task_id": "Mbpp/286", "solution": "def max_sub_array_sum_repeated(arr, n, k):\n    \"\"\"Find the largest sum of contiguous subarray in array repeated k times.\"\"\"\n    # Handle edge cases\n    if k == 1:\n        max_ending = max_so_far = arr[0]\n        for i in range(1, n):\n            max_ending = max(arr[i], max_ending + arr[i])\n            max_so_far = max(max_so_far, max_ending)\n        return max_so_far\n    \n    # Calculate prefix and suffix max sums\n    prefix_max = [0] * n\n    suffix_max = [0] * n\n    total_sum = sum(arr)\n    \n    # Calculate prefix maximums\n    curr_sum = 0\n    prefix_max[0] = arr[0]\n    curr_sum = arr[0]\n    for i in range(1, n):\n        curr_sum += arr[i]\n        prefix_max[i] = max(prefix_max[i-1], curr_sum)\n    \n    # Calculate suffix maximums\n    curr_sum = 0\n    suffix_max[n-1] = arr[n-1]\n    curr_sum = arr[n-1]\n    for i in range(n-2, -1, -1):\n        curr_sum += arr[i]\n        suffix_max[i] = max(suffix_max[i+1], curr_sum)\n    \n    # Find max subarray in single array\n    max_kadane = arr[0]\n    curr_max = arr[0]\n    for i in range(1, n):\n        curr_max = max(arr[i], curr_max + arr[i])\n        max_kadane = max(max_kadane, curr_max)\n    \n    # Result is max of three cases\n    ans = max_kadane\n    \n    # Case 2: subarray spans multiple repetitions\n    if total_sum > 0:\n        ans = max(ans, suffix_max[0] + prefix_max[n-1] + max(0, (k-2) * total_sum))\n    else:\n        ans = max(ans, suffix_max[0] + prefix_max[n-1])\n    \n    return ans"}
