{"task_id": "Mbpp/448", "solution": "def cal_sum(n):\n    \"\"\"Calculate sum of first n Perrin numbers.\"\"\"\n    if n <= 0:\n        return 0\n    \n    # Initialize first three Perrin numbers\n    p0, p1, p2 = 3, 0, 2\n    total = p0\n    \n    if n == 1:\n        return total\n    \n    total += p1\n    if n == 2:\n        return total\n    \n    total += p2\n    if n == 3:\n        return total\n    \n    # Generate remaining Perrin numbers and add to sum\n    for i in range(3, n):\n        next_perrin = p0 + p1\n        total += next_perrin\n        p0, p1, p2 = p1, p2, next_perrin\n    \n    return total"}
