{"task_id": "Mbpp/592", "solution": "def sum_Of_product(n):\n    \"\"\"Calculate sum of products of consecutive binomial coefficients.\"\"\"\n    def binomial(n, k):\n        if k > n or k < 0:\n            return 0\n        if k == 0 or k == n:\n            return 1\n        result = 1\n        for i in range(min(k, n - k)):\n            result = result * (n - i) // (i + 1)\n        return result\n    \n    total = 0\n    for i in range(n):\n        total += binomial(n, i) * binomial(n, i + 1)\n    return total"}
